 "title": "Spot the bug: SQL injection",
 "sources": [
  "OWASP SQL Injection Prevention Cheat Sheet (https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/SQL_Injection_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet.html, fetched 2026-11-24): injection is when 'untrusted data (usually strings) becomes part of a query's SQL syntax, modifying the logic of the SQL request'; unsafe example concatenates request input into the query; primary defense: 'define the SQL structure separately from its data values, then bind those values'; 'Do not manually escape untrusted values to construct SQL queries. Use parameterized queries instead.'; HQL in Hibernate built by concatenation 'may suffer from the same injection problems'.",
  "Illustration only: the login query and the ' OR 1=1 input are a textbook example written for this video; with this query the WHERE clause becomes always true and every row is returned."
 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "This login query has one bug that lets anyone in. You have three seconds. Spot it.",
   "caps": "ONE *BUG | LETS *ANYONE IN | *SPOT IT"
  },
  {
   "text": "Time's up. The bug is gluing the user's input straight into the SQL string.",
   "caps": "*TIME'S UP | *GLUING INPUT | INTO THE *SQL"
  },
  {
   "text": "Type a quote, then OR one equals one, and your input stops being data and becomes code.",
   "caps": "A *QUOTE | *OR 1=1 | DATA BECOMES *CODE"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the WHERE clause is always true, so the query returns every user.",
   "caps": "*ALWAYS TRUE | *EVERY USER"
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix is a parameterized query. The SQL stays fixed, and the input is bound as plain data.",
   "caps": "*PARAMETERIZED | SQL STAYS *FIXED | INPUT IS *DATA"
  },
  {
   "text": "But here's the catch: escaping quotes by hand is not the fix.",
   "caps": "THE *CATCH | NO *HAND ESCAPING"
  },
  {
   "text": "And an ORM won't save you either, if you build its query strings with plus signs.",
   "caps": "ORMS *TOO | NO *PLUS SIGNS"
  },
  {
   "text": "So never build SQL with string glue. Did you spot it in three seconds?",
   "caps": "NEVER *STRING GLUE | DID YOU *SPOT IT?"
  }
 ],
